D50 Gravel size:
Gravel size is important to the Atlantic Salmon spawning; too fine or too coarse, and the salmon will either not spawn or have poor egg survival (Purchase 2018). We considered 16 - 64 mm to be the most suitable substrate size, and this is represented as green on the D50 map. However, salmon may spawn in substrate that isn’t ideal, too small is represented by white on the map and too big is represented by yellow. Finally, unsuitable substrate is represented by orange.
